<!-- 终端标签：终端视图 + 状态提示（启动中、退出、断开）。快捷键与指针在视图的 code-behind 中转交给视图模型。 -->
<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:vm="using:TCode.Desktop.ViewModels"
             xmlns:tv="using:TCode.Terminal.Avalonia"
             xmlns:loc="using:TCode.Desktop.Localization"
             x:Class="TCode.Desktop.Views.TerminalTabView"
             x:DataType="vm:TerminalTabViewModel">
    <Grid RowDefinitions="*,Auto">
        <tv:TerminalView x:Name="Terminal" Grid.Row="0" Snapshot="{Binding Frame}" Padding="8" ClipToBounds="True" />
        <Border Grid.Row="0" IsVisible="{Binding Status, Converter={x:Static StringConverters.IsNotNullOrEmpty}}"
                VerticalAlignment="Bottom" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="12,6" Background="#CC1E1E1E">
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="#D4D4D4" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        </Border>
        <!-- 需要确认的操作（粘贴含换行的内容、关闭仍在运行的程序） -->
        <Border Grid.Row="0" IsVisible="{Binding HasPrompt}" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                Padding="12,8" Background="#F01E1E1E" BorderBrush="#3C3C3C" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0">
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto,Auto" ColumnSpacing="8">
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding PromptMessage}" Foreground="#D4D4D4" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                <Button Grid.Column="1" Content="{loc:TCodeLangResource Cancel}" Command="{Binding CancelPromptCommand}" />
                <Button Grid.Column="2" Content="{Binding PromptActionText}" Command="{Binding ConfirmPromptCommand}" />
            </Grid>
        </Border>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
